  "question": {
    "text": "The equation of the tangent to the conic $x^2-y^2-8 x+2 y+11=0$ at $(2,1)$ is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "YOysm",
      "text": "$x+2=0$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "5qg25",
      "text": "$2 x+1=0$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NwdIq",
      "text": "$x+y+1=0$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "4vHi5",
      "text": "$x-2=0$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints : Equation of tangent at $\\left(x_1, y_1\\right)$ is\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& x x_1-y y_1-4\\left(x+x_1\\right)+\\left(y+y_1\\right)+11=0 \\\\\n& x_1=2 ; y=1\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n$\\therefore$ Equation of tangent is\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& 2 x-y-4(x+2)+(y+1)+11=0 \\\\\n& \\text { or } \\quad-2 x-8+12=0\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{ll}\n\\text { or } & -2 x+4=0 \\\\\n\\text { or } & 2 x=4 \\\\\n\\text { or } & x=2 \\\\\n\\text { or } & x-2=0\n\\end{array}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
